[09:23:01 UTC] [INFO] {"id":55334,"date":"2021-05-24T20:32:36","date_gmt":"2021-05-24T15:02:36","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/websitedemos.net\/?post_type=astra-sites&#038;p=55334"},"modified":"2025-06-11T15:28:41","modified_gmt":"2025-06-11T09:58:41","slug":"charity-4","status":"publish","type":"astra-sites","link":"https:\/\/websitedemos.net\/astra-site\/charity-4\/","title":{"rendered":"Charity"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>The Charity template starts strong with an emotive full screen image and bold headline. Scroll past and the homepage opens up with lots of whitespace, complementing colors and a range of content areas to share the story of your charity or nonprofit.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Pages include a biography section, areas to share your good works, an image gallery and a donation section. All these can be fully customized to suit your particular needs. As can the equally attractive, and effective, supplementary pages.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key features of the Charity template<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Powerful opening ideal for emotive subjects<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Great use of complementing colors and fonts<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Lots of options for images and storytelling<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Donation section included within each page<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Full compatibility with leading page builders<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Well-designed template perfect for charities and nonprofits to raise awareness<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":170,"featured_media":55340,"template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"inline_featured_image":false,"_uag_custom_page_level_css":"","site-sidebar-layout":"default","site-content-layout":"","ast-site-content-layout":"default","site-content-style":"default","site-sidebar-style":"default","ast-global-header-display":"","ast-banner-title-visibility":"","ast-main-header-display":"","ast-hfb-above-header-display":"","ast-hfb-below-header-display":"","ast-hfb-mobile-header-